  (text "NOTES"
    (at 12.7 165.1 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.5 1.5)
        bold)
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 461b919c-cd7b-44b1-86d1-afe425ed775b))
  (text "1. Power: boost is OFF (true disconnect, ~0 uA) unless BOOST_EN (mainboard A0/PB1) is high. Spot-check HR: enable, wait ~5 ms, configure over I2C."
    (at 12.7 170.18 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 87a06d19-b0cd-4051-95ae-bfe4bb59f719))
  (text "2. MAXM86161 I2C/INTB pins are 6 V tolerant to GND (no clamp to VLED), so the shared 3 V bus is safe while U2 is unpowered."
    (at 12.7 173.99 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 2903e8da-e8f0-4dd9-ad6b-f10ba7618208))
  (text "3. Optics: two apertures in the caseback (LED / photodiode) separated by opaque material; sensor face flush with the outer surface."
    (at 12.7 177.8 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid d20a4a97-d406-49e4-b4be-ac6428ec7a1a))
  (text "4. Layout: U2 on a stiffener in the caseback window; boost section near the tail; service loop so the caseback can be removed."
    (at 12.7 182.88 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 835c6117-18ce-4007-9491-b9ac4e05afc6))
  (text "5. Pins 6/7/8 of U2 connect internally to LED cathodes: solder to isolated pads, never to GND or other nets."
    (at 12.7 187.96 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 81803137-881f-4ba6-a213-8ba00647ac24))
  (sheet_instances
    (path "/"
      (page "1"))))
